<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When I stand before the throne</l><l>Dressed in beauty not my own,</l><l>When I see Thee as Thou art,</l><l>Love Thee with unsinning heart;</l><l>Then, Lord, shall I fully know,</l><l>Not till then, how much I owe.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
